From eabb5da8dfa15390b5df761d42dba6143d62dd72 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Fri, 2 Oct 2026 19:49:56 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] feat(wifi): report station MAC and firmware version

Add Wi-Fi service command GET_ADAPTER_INFO (0x05) returning the station
interface MAC (with a present flag) and the firmware version string, so
client config tools can show adapter details. INetworkLink gains
mac_address(); ESP32 reads esp_wifi_get_mac(WIFI_IF_STA), POSIX host mode
reads /sys/class/net/<iface>/address, and simulated mode reports a fixed
locally administered address. Older firmware answers Unsupported.

Verification: ./build.sh -cp fujibus-pty-debug; ctest --test-dir
build/fujibus-pty-debug (3/3 pass, incl. new adapter-info cases).
ESP32 build not run: no ESP-IDF toolchain in this environment.

Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01WnuNydgtRyXCoECm974X7F
